<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 211 ALL OUT V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 211 ALL OUT V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 211 all out in 48.5 of their 50 overs against South Africa in the triangular tournament day-night match at Centurion Park on Saturday.</p>
</text>
